<title>USA: St. Mary Parish, La., won by Morgan Keegan.</title>
<headline>St. Mary Parish, La., won by Morgan Keegan.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Keegan &amp; Co., Inc. said it won $2.200 million of St. Mary Parish, La., genreal obligation bonds, Series 1996, with a net interest cost of 5.5856 percent.</p>
